WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.361 --> 00:00:03.080
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.900
- Here's a little weekday motivation

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.290
from someone who inspires us.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.700
- Hey friends, it is Karamo here

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.320
with your Motivational Minute.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.390
Listen, Drew and I have talked about this

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:15.000
and something we believe
in, which is hooking in.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.630
It's about finding those moments

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.700
and like, to really hold tight onto

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.210
and believe in yourself and trust

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.960
that you have what it takes

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.820
to make the moments that you
want and that you deserve.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:30.180
Hook in, hook into those
moments that feel uncomfortable,

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.590
hook into those conversations
that seem uncomfortable,

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.900
because in those moments, you'll
have the most growth ever.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:38.840
Believe in yourself, trust in yourself.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.150
And if you doubt yourself, that's okay,

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.210
because you have the
ability to ask for help.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.963
- Now, that was inspiring.

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:48.546
(upbeat music)

